This sample is deliberately left NOT APPROVED and exempt from the Stop gate.

It weighs 1 187 KB against the 500 KB this skill recommends for a local business, and
that is kept on the record rather than fixed: it is the collision between "a restaurant
page needs its food on screen" and "their customers are on mobile data", and both halves
are true. See its README.

Exempting it here is not a way around the gate. The gate has been run on it, it failed,
and the failure is written down.
